environment.description:
[ENVIRONMENT INFO:
Name: SUCC campus (Supernatural University of Central California);
Domain: Collegiate Supernatural Sanctuary & Academic Domain;
Coordinates & Span: 129 Hocus Way, coastal Solarton, California;
Setting & Metaphysics: Historic premier higher-education campus founded in 1887; balanced human-supernatural integration;
Dominant Presence: University Board of Regents, Student Body (8,000 students, 60/40 supernatural/human), Greek Row (10 houses), Faculty, DCC Fellows]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Atmosphere & Senses: Salty sea breeze mingled with coffee from The Roasted Bean, old parchment, ozone from arcane labs, freshly cut athletic turf;
Spatial Architecture: Collegiate gothic stone halls, arched cloisters, modern bioengineering glass cubes, Greek Row mansions, St. Neptune athletic complex;
Rifts & Dimensional Drift: Heavily anchored runic boundary wards preventing unauthorized dimensional tears on campus grounds;
Hazards & Rules: Strict scent suppressor compliance in lecture halls, mandatory neutral truce across rival houses and packs, no lethal dueling]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
Cosmology & Origins: Established to foster peaceful co-existence and academic mastery between supernatural lineages and mortals;
Secrets: The subterranean Basilica library basement (Room 005) hides forgotten pre-treaty pact archives and covert summoning circles]

location.description:
[LOCATION INFO:
Era: 2024 (Modern Fantasy / Post-Gate Era);
Location: Gym & Changing Facilities (Recreation Building, SUCC Campus);
Setting: Heavy-duty university fitness center and locker rooms equipped for superhuman strength and mass;
Factions: Campus Recreation Staff, Heavy Lifters, Demihuman Fitness Club;
Conflicts: Wear-and-tear on heavy equipment from superhuman strength, crowded free-weight zones during evening rush;
Society: Dedicated fitness grind, mutual spotting camaraderie, non-judgmental encouragement across body types]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Environment: Scent of rubber floor mats, athletic sweat, barbell iron, disinfectant spray, and motivating techno beats;
Architecture: Expansive multi-tier fitness floor, reinforced dumbbell racks with weights up to 300 lbs, heavy power cages, locker rooms;
Security & Wards: Reinforced concrete floors absorbing dropped weights, emergency medical defibrillators, turnstile ID access;
Demographics: Supernatural athletes, minotaurs, werewolves conditioning stamina, human students working out;
Rules & Restrictions: Wipe down machines after use, re-rack heavy plates, clip collars onto barbells before heavy lifts]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
History: Continually upgraded to ensure students with extreme physical strength can train safely without breaking standard gym gear;
Secrets: The rear training room features hydraulic resistance machines engineered by DCC contractors for hybrid shift conditioning]
